      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here is my proposal: The Spawn Object action should have a default Cooldown of 1s, with an advanced settings checkbox to change the Cooldown time. This will allow the majority of new creators to not accidentally allow spamming, as well as allowing advanced creators to still use rapid spawns for monsters/bullets etc. or even to increase the Cooldown time.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
